(5665573, 824247, 80780, '<td valign="top">I think a little bit lower of an angle, would be very cool, you would end up with more of the buildings on the right, but I think having that bridge stretch a little further out into the background would be a cool effect.</td>', 'I think a little bit lower of an angle, would be very cool, you would end up with more of the buildings on the right, but I think having that bridge stretch a little further out into the background would be a cool effect.', '2009-09-28 22:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5665580, 824199, 80780, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I love how the light illuminates all those little fibers like that.</td>', 'Nice image, I love how the light illuminates all those little fibers like that.', '2009-09-28 22:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5665582, 823719, 80780, '<td valign="top">That is an x of epic proportions.</td>', 'That is an x of epic proportions.', '2009-09-28 22:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5665585, 824227, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but it seems dark to me. When there''s a sign, you naturally want to read it. So your eyes are drawn to it, and then you notice that it should have been white, and you realize that it would have washed out the water too much, etc. The point is, it ends up being distracting. It seems like either lightening it or silhouetting it might have worked better...  -5-</td>', 'Interesting shot, but it seems dark to me. When there''s a sign, you naturally want to read it. So your eyes are drawn to it, and then you notice that it should have been white, and you realize that it would have washed out the water too much, etc. The point is, it ends up being distracting. It seems like either lightening it or silhouetting it might have worked better...  -5-', '2009-09-28 22:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5665586, 822833, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot, but I think you''re going to be hit by the lack of an overtly obvious x...</td>', 'This is a really cool shot, but I think you''re going to be hit by the lack of an overtly obvious x...', '2009-09-28 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
