(5666721, 823852, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is definitely one of the best in the challenge, IMO. I like the lighting for the most part and you did a good job of meeting the challenge using an unique approach to portraiture. Couple nitpicks: model''s left arm is slightly not parallel, and I would also like to see a little bit more light on her feet since they seem sorta cut off as is. Maybe it''s just my monitor, but I can see a bit of your background as well, which I''d prefer not to. Either way, strong photo.</td>', 'This is definitely one of the best in the challenge, IMO. I like the lighting for the most part and you did a good job of meeting the challenge using an unique approach to portraiture. Couple nitpicks: model''s left arm is slightly not parallel, and I would also like to see a little bit more light on her feet since they seem sorta cut off as is. Maybe it''s just my monitor, but I can see a bit of your background as well, which I''d prefer not to. Either way, strong photo.', '2009-09-30 01:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
