(5668513, 824247, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ve always been intrigued by these ''under the bridge'' photos. There are no bridges where I live - only overpasses and they don''t count and aren''t as cool. And hey!...it looks like you caught a star in this photo..way cool...! 10</td>', 'I''ve always been intrigued by these ''under the bridge'' photos. There are no bridges where I live - only overpasses and they don''t count and aren''t as cool. And hey!...it looks like you caught a star in this photo..way cool...! 10', '2009-10-01 00:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
