(5668521, 823759, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks a little cartoon-like, which is not necessarily a bad thing, but an awesomely cool photo and excellent idea. If I held my tongue then I wouldn''t be able to tell you I gave your photo a 9.</td>', 'It looks a little cartoon-like, which is not necessarily a bad thing, but an awesomely cool photo and excellent idea. If I held my tongue then I wouldn''t be able to tell you I gave your photo a 9.', '2009-10-01 00:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
