(5670181, 824161, 31456, '<td valign="top">I really like the "pop" in this, and the "X" is very clear. The bottom-right building seems a little gray, but that''s not really a flaw. I''d like it to be straighter, though. 9</td>', 'I really like the "pop" in this, and the "X" is very clear. The bottom-right building seems a little gray, but that''s not really a flaw. I''d like it to be straighter, though. 9', '2009-10-01 20:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670190, 823352, 31456, '<td valign="top">Her right arm seems a little tight compared to her left, and the shadows on her body are a bit distracting, but they''re a matter of taste, really. I like the light coming from the side and her facial expression, and the tones are excellent. 9</td>', 'Her right arm seems a little tight compared to her left, and the shadows on her body are a bit distracting, but they''re a matter of taste, really. I like the light coming from the side and her facial expression, and the tones are excellent. 9', '2009-10-01 20:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670192, 823852, 31456, '<td valign="top">My girlfriend thinks her head being there is distracting, but I disagree. The look on her face is great, though I can''t think of how to put it into words. Is it "what ya'' lookin'' at, foo''?" Yeah, didn''t think so... I''m not too good with these things. 9</td>', 'My girlfriend thinks her head being there is distracting, but I disagree. The look on her face is great, though I can''t think of how to put it into words. Is it "what ya'' lookin'' at, foo''?" Yeah, didn''t think so... I''m not too good with these things. 9', '2009-10-01 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670197, 824234, 31456, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, and surprisingly sharp (I''m assuming a long exposure here, especially with the deep DOF). Speaking of DOF, great DOF. The X doesn''t jump out at me in the large image, but it does in the thumbnail, but that''s probably because I tend to see the details in the large one and the overall image in the thumbnail. 9</td>', 'Wonderful colors, and surprisingly sharp (I''m assuming a long exposure here, especially with the deep DOF). Speaking of DOF, great DOF. The X doesn''t jump out at me in the large image, but it does in the thumbnail, but that''s probably because I tend to see the details in the large one and the overall image in the thumbnail. 9', '2009-10-01 20:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670200, 823366, 31456, '<td valign="top">Some crazy stuff going on in this one, those reflections are out of this world. I love getting lost in these abstract images, especially when they''re done as beautifully as this one. 9</td>', 'Some crazy stuff going on in this one, those reflections are out of this world. I love getting lost in these abstract images, especially when they''re done as beautifully as this one. 9', '2009-10-01 20:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670202, 824188, 31456, '<td valign="top">Why... so... serious? The tones on her forehead and neck are a bit flat, and there are some underexposed areas around her nose. Other than that, I really really like it. The concept and the look in her eyes are both perfect. 8</td>', 'Why... so... serious? The tones on her forehead and neck are a bit flat, and there are some underexposed areas around her nose. Other than that, I really really like it. The concept and the look in her eyes are both perfect. 8', '2009-10-01 21:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670206, 823889, 31456, '<td valign="top">I see the X, and it''s huge, but if it were a different challenge, I wouldn''t be thinking "Wow, an X!" Other than that, it''s great. And I''m a sucker for sunrises and sunsets done well, so there''s some bonus points. 8</td>', 'I see the X, and it''s huge, but if it were a different challenge, I wouldn''t be thinking "Wow, an X!" Other than that, it''s great. And I''m a sucker for sunrises and sunsets done well, so there''s some bonus points. 8', '2009-10-01 21:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670207, 824207, 31456, '<td valign="top">Well, sex sells! 8</td>', 'Well, sex sells! 8', '2009-10-01 21:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670212, 823707, 31456, '<td valign="top">Not sure it''s legal, but I''ll assume it is. I like the reflection, I just wish I could see a little more of it and less of the shadow going to the right. Also, I like that the tones on her body are balanced (not under- or overexposed). 8</td>', 'Not sure it''s legal, but I''ll assume it is. I like the reflection, I just wish I could see a little more of it and less of the shadow going to the right. Also, I like that the tones on her body are balanced (not under- or overexposed). 8', '2009-10-01 21:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670218, 823330, 31456, '<td valign="top">Actually, it''s X-X-X &lt;br&gt; X-X-X &lt;br&gt; X-X-X. A tad over-/underexposed in some parts, and too centered. Still better than anything I could''ve done, especially in black and white. 7</td>', 'Actually, it''s X-X-X <br> X-X-X <br> X-X-X. A tad over-/underexposed in some parts, and too centered. Still better than anything I could''ve done, especially in black and white. 7', '2009-10-01 21:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670222, 823739, 31456, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the harshness of the lighting on the straight thing on the right, and the little black thing on the left (I''m assuming you''re using it to frame the cog, it''s just not working for me), I''d give it an 8. Speaking of lighting, the lighting on the cog is great, and really brings out the details. 7<br/> <br/>Just a note - the black part of your border seems smaller on the top and left. If that''s correct, try resizing to something like 700x??? first and then adding the border.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the harshness of the lighting on the straight thing on the right, and the little black thing on the left (I''m assuming you''re using it to frame the cog, it''s just not working for me), I''d give it an 8. Speaking of lighting, the lighting on the cog is great, and really brings out the details. 7 Just a note - the black part of your border seems smaller on the top and left. If that''s correct, try resizing to something like 700x??? first and then adding the border.', '2009-10-01 21:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670224, 823523, 31456, '<td valign="top">Whee! I like this a lot. Great tones in the sky. 8</td>', 'Whee! I like this a lot. Great tones in the sky. 8', '2009-10-01 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670226, 823902, 31456, '<td valign="top">Aww! The border style isn''t working for me but that''s okay. Good concept, great lighting, great expression on her face, and it''s off center too! 9</td>', 'Aww! The border style isn''t working for me but that''s okay. Good concept, great lighting, great expression on her face, and it''s off center too! 9', '2009-10-01 21:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670235, 822807, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice image, though it doesn''t really have the wow factor of others in this challenge. Also, some perfect blacks around the leaves are a little distracting (too much burning?). Still a great image that deserves an 8</td>', 'Nice image, though it doesn''t really have the wow factor of others in this challenge. Also, some perfect blacks around the leaves are a little distracting (too much burning?). Still a great image that deserves an 8', '2009-10-01 21:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670242, 824235, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and Xs all over the place; my eyes keep going around the image looking for a focus point and not finding any. 7</td>', 'Nice colors and Xs all over the place; my eyes keep going around the image looking for a focus point and not finding any. 7', '2009-10-01 21:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670269, 823913, 31456, '<td valign="top">Great idea and subject placement, and the blood stains are a nice touch. I think a less busy pattern on his shirt and less harsh lighting would have helped. 7</td>', 'Great idea and subject placement, and the blood stains are a nice touch. I think a less busy pattern on his shirt and less harsh lighting would have helped. 7', '2009-10-01 21:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670275, 823978, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a little uninteresting to me. 6</td>', 'Nice shot, but a little uninteresting to me. 6', '2009-10-01 21:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670278, 823836, 31456, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of centered subjects, and power (?) lines are kind of uninteresting. So it''s really a matter of taste. To me it''s a 6</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of centered subjects, and power (?) lines are kind of uninteresting. So it''s really a matter of taste. To me it''s a 6', '2009-10-01 21:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670280, 823796, 31456, '<td valign="top">Although the X is not the first thing that jumps out at me, it''s big and it''s ON the first thing that jumps out. Nice, crisp colors on the boat (kind of oversaturated on the sky), and good sharpness and DOF. I would''ve liked the horizon to be straight. 7</td>', 'Although the X is not the first thing that jumps out at me, it''s big and it''s ON the first thing that jumps out. Nice, crisp colors on the boat (kind of oversaturated on the sky), and good sharpness and DOF. I would''ve liked the horizon to be straight. 7', '2009-10-01 21:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670282, 824159, 31456, '<td valign="top">Too centered and kind of noisy, but good DoF and great detail on the penny. 7</td>', 'Too centered and kind of noisy, but good DoF and great detail on the penny. 7', '2009-10-01 21:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670285, 824205, 31456, '<td valign="top">Hm, it seems I voted on this too quickly, I don''t know why I''d give it a 7. A bit busy and the colors are a bit bland, but this deserves an 8.</td>', 'Hm, it seems I voted on this too quickly, I don''t know why I''d give it a 7. A bit busy and the colors are a bit bland, but this deserves an 8.', '2009-10-01 21:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670290, 824184, 31456, '<td valign="top">Ah, another centered X with another two centered subjects. Nice tones and good sharpness/DoF. Aside from the composition, I find it kind of uninteresting. 6</td>', 'Ah, another centered X with another two centered subjects. Nice tones and good sharpness/DoF. Aside from the composition, I find it kind of uninteresting. 6', '2009-10-01 21:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670295, 824252, 31456, '<td valign="top">The X doesn''t pop out at me. Other than that, it''s great - good detail, the very blurry background IS working for me in this case (looks almost like parchment), and good subject placement (NOT dead-center). 7</td>', 'The X doesn''t pop out at me. Other than that, it''s great - good detail, the very blurry background IS working for me in this case (looks almost like parchment), and good subject placement (NOT dead-center). 7', '2009-10-01 21:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670298, 823830, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I don''t love it. 7</td>', 'I like it, but I don''t love it. 7', '2009-10-01 21:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670301, 824247, 31456, '<td valign="top">Plenty of X''s here, and my eyes aren''t wandering around aimlessly. Not the most interesting of subjects, I''m afraid (even for a future civil engineer). Good colors. I''m sure moving the subject off-center (to the left) would''ve made it lose some X-ness, but it may have worked better composition-wise. 6</td>', 'Plenty of X''s here, and my eyes aren''t wandering around aimlessly. Not the most interesting of subjects, I''m afraid (even for a future civil engineer). Good colors. I''m sure moving the subject off-center (to the left) would''ve made it lose some X-ness, but it may have worked better composition-wise. 6', '2009-10-01 21:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670303, 824206, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp colors and very sharp. I''m not as drawn to it as I am to others in this challenge, though. 6</td>', 'Nice, crisp colors and very sharp. I''m not as drawn to it as I am to others in this challenge, though. 6', '2009-10-01 21:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670305, 824193, 31456, '<td valign="top">A little noisy, but good sharpness at the intersection and good DoF. I''m not getting the whole story, though... I feel like it needs something else. A setting, with either more thorny things or a fence or a few more rose stems (?) at varying degrees of sharpness... Anyway, it''s a 6 from me.</td>', 'A little noisy, but good sharpness at the intersection and good DoF. I''m not getting the whole story, though... I feel like it needs something else. A setting, with either more thorny things or a fence or a few more rose stems (?) at varying degrees of sharpness... Anyway, it''s a 6 from me.', '2009-10-01 21:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670309, 824248, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like the varying degrees of brightness, but there''s no real subject to focus on here and the colors are a bit dull. Good sharpness, and nice framing by the reflections on the top and bottom. 6</td>', 'I like the varying degrees of brightness, but there''s no real subject to focus on here and the colors are a bit dull. Good sharpness, and nice framing by the reflections on the top and bottom. 6', '2009-10-01 21:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670313, 824199, 31456, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh for me, but other than that, I like everything from a technical standpoint.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh for me, but other than that, I like everything from a technical standpoint.', '2009-10-01 21:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670314, 824195, 31456, '<td valign="top">Whoa, there''s something I didn''t expect to see in this challenge. And especially this sharp. I don''t think the shadows are deep enough, and the background is a bit too blurry. Gave it a 6 before, but it''s growing on me. 7</td>', 'Whoa, there''s something I didn''t expect to see in this challenge. And especially this sharp. I don''t think the shadows are deep enough, and the background is a bit too blurry. Gave it a 6 before, but it''s growing on me. 7', '2009-10-01 21:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670317, 823759, 90414, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this image a good half dozen times before coming back to comment. So many textures and colors here, it is quite amazing. I love the dramatic lighting against the dark bg. The idea is dramatic and graphic as well; I could see it as a book cover in fact.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this image a good half dozen times before coming back to comment. So many textures and colors here, it is quite amazing. I love the dramatic lighting against the dark bg. The idea is dramatic and graphic as well; I could see it as a book cover in fact.', '2009-10-01 21:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670318, 822845, 31456, '<td valign="top">A bit too noisy in the shadows (HDR will do that... I''m assuming it''s HDR... it looks like it''s HDR...), and the "X" IS kind of twisted. Nice colors in the sky, and the red is sexy. 6</td>', 'A bit too noisy in the shadows (HDR will do that... I''m assuming it''s HDR... it looks like it''s HDR...), and the "X" IS kind of twisted. Nice colors in the sky, and the red is sexy. 6', '2009-10-01 21:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670320, 823737, 31456, '<td valign="top">I really like those waves. Kind of harsh on some of the colors, but I really like those waves. The "X" looks like it was the result of a cross/star filter, but I really like those waves. 5 without the (crazy) waves, 7 with the waves</td>', 'I really like those waves. Kind of harsh on some of the colors, but I really like those waves. The "X" looks like it was the result of a cross/star filter, but I really like those waves. 5 without the (crazy) waves, 7 with the waves', '2009-10-01 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670323, 823889, 90414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - the silhouette looks 3-D! Excellent job.</td>', 'Beautiful image - the silhouette looks 3-D! Excellent job.', '2009-10-01 21:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670326, 824088, 90414, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but kind of an awkward crop.</td>', 'Nice capture, but kind of an awkward crop.', '2009-10-01 21:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670327, 822988, 31456, '<td valign="top">I''m a violin player, so the X was kind of hard to see because I see it every day and I don''t usually think of it as an X. Also, some of the shadows are too dark (a small part of the fingerboard and half of the tailpiece are completely black). I like the colors and it is tack-sharp. 7</td>', 'I''m a violin player, so the X was kind of hard to see because I see it every day and I don''t usually think of it as an X. Also, some of the shadows are too dark (a small part of the fingerboard and half of the tailpiece are completely black). I like the colors and it is tack-sharp. 7', '2009-10-01 21:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670331, 823910, 31456, '<td valign="top">Very nice image with great color, but the "X" is kind of a stretch for me, it''s not really the X that jumps out but the dew itself (or is it rain?). 6</td>', 'Very nice image with great color, but the "X" is kind of a stretch for me, it''s not really the X that jumps out but the dew itself (or is it rain?). 6', '2009-10-01 21:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670332, 824106, 31456, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s an X... but the image is kind of shapshot-ish (kind of like mine). Also, something happened with some shades of gray where they became really flat, like underexposed shadows. 5</td>', 'Well, there''s an X... but the image is kind of shapshot-ish (kind of like mine). Also, something happened with some shades of gray where they became really flat, like underexposed shadows. 5', '2009-10-01 21:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
