(5670346, 824236, 31456, '<td valign="top">Even though the CN Tower goes up way past the others and the "X" is centered, the "X" isn''t really what pops out at me. It just looks like a normal (and successful) attempt at creating an interesting image with a tilted horizon. 6</td>', 'Even though the CN Tower goes up way past the others and the "X" is centered, the "X" isn''t really what pops out at me. It just looks like a normal (and successful) attempt at creating an interesting image with a tilted horizon. 6', '2009-10-01 22:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
