(5673315, 824106, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have to give you kudos just for having the sheer cajones to enter something like this. On the other hand, you may be intentionally shooting for the brown, so, idunno how to take this one. <br/> <br/>Well, upon some thought, there is no way this will score highly, so a high vote would be a wasted effort. I may as well help you with some sort of achievement, so brown it is. If that is not what you were shooting for, I apologize.</td>', 'I have to give you kudos just for having the sheer cajones to enter something like this. On the other hand, you may be intentionally shooting for the brown, so, idunno how to take this one.  Well, upon some thought, there is no way this will score highly, so a high vote would be a wasted effort. I may as well help you with some sort of achievement, so brown it is. If that is not what you were shooting for, I apologize.', '2009-10-03 17:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
