(5675090, 823796, 83313, '<td valign="top">I did look at the Wikipedia entry for Swastika during voting, and found there are a number of variations from different cultures. I never knew that before.  This one is different from the usual Nazi version in that the arms go the opposite way. Still gives the same impression however. Regardless, it is still a good photo and I realized the symbolism was not intentional on your part. Got an 8 from me, though I expect that symbolism is what kept this from getting a higher average.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-05 00:28:17.</i></td>', 'I did look at the Wikipedia entry for Swastika during voting, and found there are a number of variations from different cultures. I never knew that before.  This one is different from the usual Nazi version in that the arms go the opposite way. Still gives the same impression however. Regardless, it is still a good photo and I realized the symbolism was not intentional on your part. Got an 8 from me, though I expect that symbolism is what kept this from getting a higher average.', '2009-10-05 01:26:10.000000', '2009-10-05 01:28:17.000000', 0),
