(5675230, 824174, 66635, '<td valign="top">I have to agree that this is a beautiful shot, but doesn''t meet the challenge.  Sure, you could say that every single blade of grass is crossed with another and therefore forms an "x", but I think that when something is the theme of a challenge, it has to be very prominent - usually the most prominent aspect of the photo.  Not sure if I said that well, but you probably get my meaning.</td>', 'I have to agree that this is a beautiful shot, but doesn''t meet the challenge.  Sure, you could say that every single blade of grass is crossed with another and therefore forms an "x", but I think that when something is the theme of a challenge, it has to be very prominent - usually the most prominent aspect of the photo.  Not sure if I said that well, but you probably get my meaning.', '2009-10-05 05:44:22.000000', NULL, 0),
