(5675673, 824106, 99412, '<td valign="top">Just goes to show you. <br/>What one person would normally leave for the buzzards, others will cook, burn and eat. <br/>That''s what makes us all unique as people.<br/> <br/>I guess in some cultures, we are just not used to seeing cooked heads on the menu.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the ribbon and by all means, enjoy your dinner.<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Just goes to show you. What one person would normally leave for the buzzards, others will cook, burn and eat. That''s what makes us all unique as people. I guess in some cultures, we are just not used to seeing cooked heads on the menu. Congratulations on the ribbon and by all means, enjoy your dinner. :)', '2009-10-05 15:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
