(5675713, 824252, 60698, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe the score for this wonderful shot is in the 4''s!  I voted very high on this one because I know how difficult it is to capture a dragonfly in flight. Manual focus too! Wonderful! I see the x in the wings. Maybe if you called it x-wing... ? :)</td>', 'I can''t believe the score for this wonderful shot is in the 4''s!  I voted very high on this one because I know how difficult it is to capture a dragonfly in flight. Manual focus too! Wonderful! I see the x in the wings. Maybe if you called it x-wing... ? :)', '2009-10-05 16:05:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5675727, 823852, 87252, '<td valign="top">WOW! I saw this on the front page and was a bit like hmmm... that''s familiar... I take my hat off to you, excellent execution. Thanks for the credit but I probably wouldn''t have come up with this for the challenge so I can''t really take much, this came out of your head. This has helped me to realise that I was more creative once upon a time and that I really should start applying myself more, so thanks for that, I''m going to try to get more involved again.<br/> <br/>Grats again. Fave!</td>', 'WOW! I saw this on the front page and was a bit like hmmm... that''s familiar... I take my hat off to you, excellent execution. Thanks for the credit but I probably wouldn''t have come up with this for the challenge so I can''t really take much, this came out of your head. This has helped me to realise that I was more creative once upon a time and that I really should start applying myself more, so thanks for that, I''m going to try to get more involved again. Grats again. Fave!', '2009-10-05 16:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
